import json,re,sys
from pathlib import Path
root=Path(sys.argv[1]);data={}
CASES={
 'veto':('The distant dragon that vetoed the emergency bolt',
  'A level-fourteen mage with no mana - the emergency premise - faces a kobold two grids away while a young red dragon stands far across the arena, observed first so it owns the lower kill index. The original monster loop breaks at the first live monster: the distant dragon is the one examined, its hit points veto the emergency magic missile, and the maneuver is valued at zero. The correction scans every monster and applies the veto to the near ones it describes: the dragon is skipped, the kobold qualifies, and the maneuver is valued.'),
 'control':('Control: only the kobold',
  'The same mage with no mana faces only the kobold. The first live monster is the right one, so the original and the correction value the maneuver identically at fifty, and the complete log is byte-identical: the fix changes only which monsters the scan examines.')}
for mode,(label,explanation) in CASES.items():
 item={'label':label,'explanation':explanation}
 for phase in ('before','after'):
  raw=(root/f'{phase}-{mode}.log').read_text()
  entry={'raw':raw,'passed':'native-c/reserve-258 finished: 1/1 passed' in raw}
  for tag in ('GEOMETRY ','RATING ','OUTCOME '):
   match=re.search(re.escape(tag)+r'(.*)',raw)
   entry[tag.split()[0].lower()]=match[1].strip() if match else None
  item[phase]=entry
 data[mode]=item
html='''<!doctype html><html lang="en"><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>The emergency bolt that never fired</title><style>body{margin:0;background:#f4f1ea;color:#253a3c;font:18px/1.6 system-ui}main{max-width:1100px;margin:auto;padding:32px 24px}h1{font-size:40px;line-height:1.2}h2{font-size:24px}.cards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:20px}.card{background:white;border:1px solid #cbd6d0;border-radius:12px;padding:24px;margin:18px 0}.cards .card{border-top:6px solid #648e80}.num{font-size:34px;font-weight:750}select,button{font:inherit;max-width:100%;padding:10px;border:1px solid #aabdb5;border-radius:7px;background:white}button{cursor:pointer;margin:14px 8px 0 0}button.active{background:#24685d;color:white}.summary{background:#e6eee6;padding:20px;border-left:5px solid #377367}pre{white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere;font:13px/1.5 monospace;max-height:330px;overflow:auto}details{background:white;padding:20px;margin:20px 0}summary{font-weight:700;cursor:pointer}@media(max-width:650px){.cards{grid-template-columns:1fr}h1{font-size:30px}}</style><main><p>Recorded native reserve-bolt valuations</p><h1>The emergency bolt that never fired</h1><p>The emergency magic missile is the young mage's last resort: it is only considered when the mage no longer has the mana to cast anything, and it should fire at the one nearby weak monster rather than risk fainting among several. The monster scan behind that decision broke at the first live monster, so it examined whichever monster happened to own the lowest kill index - and a distant tough monster vetoed the bolt for a nearby weak one, while the count of nearby monsters could never exceed one.</p><section class="card"><label for="scenario">Choose a recorded situation</label><br><select id="scenario"></select><p id="explanation"></p><br><button data-step="0">Maneuver value</button></section><div class="cards"><section id="original" class="card"><h2>Original</h2><div class="num"></div><p class="state"></p></section><section id="compared" class="card"><h2>Corrected</h2><div class="num"></div><p class="state"></p></section></div><p class="summary" id="outcome"></p><h2>What the control establishes</h2><p>With only the kobold present, the first live monster is the right one and both variants value the maneuver identically at fifty, byte for byte: the correction changes only which monsters the scan examines.</p><details><summary>Experiment conditions and limits</summary><p>Native Human Mage level fourteen, depth five, seed one thousand, lit constructed arena, zero current mana with a full maximum (the emergency premise), avoidance tuned low so the pair of monsters clears the must-be-dangerous gate. The kobold stands two grids away; the young red dragon fourteen grids away, observed first so it owns the lower kill index. The measurement calls the public maneuver chooser with borg_simulate set. This isolates the monster scan, not full autonomous play. No death or survival claim.</p></details><details><summary>Recorded native output</summary><h3>Original</h3><pre id="original-log"></pre><h3>Corrected</h3><pre id="compared-log"></pre></details><p>Canonical report: <a href="https://github.com/diegoami/neo-angband-tracker/issues/258">issue258</a>.</p></main><script>
const data=__DATA__;const select=document.getElementById('scenario');for(const [key,c] of Object.entries(data)){let o=document.createElement('option');o.value=key;o.textContent=c.label;select.append(o)}function draw(){let c=data[select.value];document.getElementById('explanation').textContent=c.explanation;for(const [panel,phase] of [['original','before'],['compared','after']]){let d=c[phase],p=document.getElementById(panel);let r=d.rating||'';let m=r.match(/value=(-?\\d+)/);p.querySelector('.num').textContent='Maneuver value: '+(m?m[1]:'n/a');p.querySelector('.state').textContent=d.outcome||'';document.getElementById(panel+'-log').textContent=d.raw}document.getElementById('outcome').textContent=select.value==='veto'?'The original values the emergency bolt at 0 - the distant dragon vetoes it; the correction skips the distant dragon and values it at 40.':'Only the kobold stands: 50 either way, byte for byte.';}select.addEventListener('change',draw);draw();</script></html>'''
(root/'replay.html').write_text(html.replace('__DATA__',json.dumps(data).replace('<','\\u003c')))
(root/'replay-data.json').write_text(json.dumps(data,indent=2)+'\n')
print('Open in your browser:',root/'replay.html')
